    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2GtzUm5hXcLmjePs7nN39W2)_\n\nSettles ADR 0020 and implements it.\n\n- **Unsorted group:** a tag in no group is allowed. `sp-org-tag-group-of` answers `(\"unsorted\")`: no emoji, default colour, no warning. The tag menu heads them `unsorted`, last. `M-x sp-org-tag-groups-list-unsorted` lists them.\n- **Registry from groups:** `sp-org-tag-registry.el` now sets `sp-org-tag-groups-alist` and `sp-org-tag-groups-ungrouped` and derives `org-tag-persistent-alist` from them (`sp-org-tag-groups-to-alist`, Org's group-tag form). `sp-org-tag-add` asks for the group and inserts the tag in that element. `sp-org-tag-groups` no longer holds a copy of the data. Group names are registered tags and are in their own group.\n- **ADR 0020:** records both decisions and what was implemented, including that a member named like its group is left out of the Org form.\n- Docs (`.org`) and tangled `.el` edited together; tests and CHANGELOG updated.\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container); tangle done by hand.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCP1EeS4LxrGn5uw6X",
